{"seq":75,"slug":"web-accessibility-implementation-testing","title":"Web 无障碍开发","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"web-无障碍开发\">Web 无障碍开发</h1><p>Web 无障碍（Web Accessibility，常缩写为 a11y）是确保所有用户——包括视觉、听觉、运动、认知等方面存在障碍的用户——都能平等感知、理解、导航和交互 Web 内容的工程实践。2026 年，随着 WCAG 2.2 成为全球法律合规的事实标准、欧洲无障碍法案（EAA）全面执行、美国 ADA Title II 合规截止日逼近，无障碍已从「锦上添花」变为前端工程的一等公民。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本仓库 <code>01_frontend</code> 下已有 <code>34_web-accessibility</code> hub，它侧重于无障碍的<strong>概念基础与感知层</strong>（用户模型、ARIA 角色入门、屏幕阅读器原理、颜色对比度）。本 hub <code>75_web-accessibility-implementation-testing</code> 聚焦于<strong>工程实战与 2026 前沿</strong>：从 WCAG 2.2/3.0 标准演进、可访问性树的程序化操作、ARIA APG 组件模式，到 axe-core 自动化测试集成、CI 管线门控、SPA 动态内容无障碍、认知无障碍等进阶主题。两者互补——前者是「为什么」和「是什么」，本 hub 是「怎么做」和「做到什么程度」。</p>\n<p>与 <code>68_frontend-design-tokens-systems</code> 的关系：设计令牌是无障碍视觉一致性的底层保障（对比度令牌、焦点环令牌），本 hub 在实现章节引用其令牌体系。与 <code>65_frontend-state-machines-statecharts</code> 的关系：状态机是复杂交互组件（对话框、下拉菜单、手风琴）焦点管理的建模工具，本 hub 在组件模式章节引用其状态转换方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A — 从零建立无障碍意识的前端开发者：</strong> 基础篇全部 → 实现篇 1-2-3 → 测试篇 1 → 进阶篇 2。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B — 已有基础、需要在项目中落地的工程师：</strong> 基础篇 1（标准速查） → 实现篇 3（APG 组件） → 测试篇全部 → 进阶篇 1-3。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C — 技术负责人 / 架构师：</strong> 基础篇 1 → 测试篇 3（CI 管线） → 进阶篇 3（组织流程） → 按需深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 前，建议具备：HTML5 语义标签基本认知、CSS 布局基础、JavaScript DOM 操作经验、至少一个前端框架（React/Vue/Angular）的组件开发经验。如果对无障碍完全陌生，建议先阅读 <code>34_web-accessibility</code> 的基础篇建立概念模型。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wcag-standards-evolution","title":"WCAG 标准演进与合规决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/foundations/wcag-standards-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"semantic-html-accessibility-tree","title":"语义 HTML 与可访问性树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/foundations/semantic-html-accessibility-tree"},{"seq":3,"slug":"disability-models-user-needs","title":"残障模型与用户需求全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/foundations/disability-models-user-needs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"实现篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aria-roles-properties","title":"ARIA 角色、状态与属性实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/aria-roles-properties"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keyboard-navigation-focus","title":"键盘导航与焦点管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/keyboard-navigation-focus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accessible-components-patterns","title":"WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/accessible-components-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing","title":"测试篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"automated-accessibility-testing","title":"自动化无障碍测试与 axe-core","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/automated-accessibility-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"screen-reader-manual-testing","title":"屏幕阅读器与手动测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/screen-reader-manual-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-accessibility-pipeline","title":"CI 无障碍管线门控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/ci-accessibility-pipeline"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cognitive-accessibility","title":"认知无障碍工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/advanced/cognitive-accessibility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spa-dynamic-content-a11y","title":"SPA 与动态内容无障碍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/advanced/spa-dynamic-content-a11y"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inclusive-design-process","title":"包容性设计流程与组织成熟度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/advanced/inclusive-design-process"}]}]}